{"id":709,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Small roots that extend from the tips of this Pokémon’s feet can tie into the trees of the forest and give Trevenant control over them."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"People fear it due to a belief that it devours any who try to cut down trees in its forest, but to the Pokémon it shares its woods with, it’s kind."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"This Pokémon controls trees via roots stretching from its feet, and it will attack anyone that dares to ravage the forest."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It’s feared as a ghost of the forest. Lumberjacks bring along Fire types, which Trevenant hates, when they enter the forest."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Through its roots, it exerts control over other trees. A deadly curse falls upon anyone cutting down trees in forests where Trevenant dwell."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"This Pokémon is said to devour anyone daring to ravage the forest. To the creatures dwelling in the forest, it offers great kindness."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y"],"text":"Using its roots as a nervous system, it controls the trees in the forest. It’s kind to the Pokémon that reside in its body."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X"],"text":"It can control trees at will. It will trap people who harm the forest, so they can never leave."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Natural Cure","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's status conditions are cured when it switches out."},{"name":"Frisk","hidden":false,"description":"When it enters a battle, the Pokémon can check an opposing Pokémon's held item."},{"name":"Harvest","hidden":true,"description":"May create another Berry after one is used."}],"eggGroups":["Grass","Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Brown","shape":"Tentacles","evolution":{"id":708,"name":"Phantump","condition":null,"children":[{"id":709,"name":"Trevenant","condition":"Trade","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":